Package: desman-layouts-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, xkb-data (>= 2.0), perl-base
Provides: us-de-layout
Replaces: us-de-layout
Conflicts: us-de-layout
Description: US-DE and Russian mnemonic keyboard layouts
 Adds XKB layouts: us-de (US with German umlauts and dead accents on RAlt),
 ru-us-mn and ru-de-mn (Russian mnemonic over US and German keyboards) and
 ru-ralt-us (Russian with the plain US layout on RAlt).
 The layouts are registered in evdev.xml so layout tools list them.
 The original evdev.xml is safely modified and restored on removal.
